// Controlled-drug register lines are kept as they were written. Nothing here rewrites a patient's older lines
// to a new spelling of their ID card: every reader matches the card through mtIdCardLookupKeys (123M, 0000123M
// and "123 m" are the same card), and a deliberate change of card on all of a person's records is
// POST /people/:id/change-id-card, which is confirmed, audited and undoable.

async function handleDdaSalesClientLookup(request, env, corsOkHeaders, authUser, url) {
