//     runs the route's own handler unchanged, and after a 2xx compares after with before inside ctx.waitUntil (the save
//     is not slowed): one notice line per person per save ("Your Tue 12 Nov shift changed to 13:30–19:30") and one
//     empty VAPID-signed push per device of that person. A push service answering 404/410 drops the device.
//   - GET /rota/notices?sub=<id>&k=<secret> (public, authenticated by the device's own secret): the service worker
//     reads the text to show, newest first; what it read is marked seen.
