// locum register and the handover). Plain rows; the cover rule, the words and the colours are the screen's
// (E.teamCover in ui/core.js, ui/eikon.teamtoday.js). At most 8 statements, each bounded by the pharmacy and a date, a
// short range or a LIMIT, on the existing indexes:
//  1. today's shifts with the person's name, role and phone (idx_shift_assign_org_date);
//  2. approved leave covering today (idx_shift_leaves_org: approved, started within the last year, not ended);
//  3. the opening hours and the rota settings (one row each, one statement);
//  4. today's locum register (idx_locum_register_org_loc_date): the pharmacist in charge;
//  5. the handover left for today: the last day before today with points, up to four days back, as the Handover screen
//     reads it (instructions_daily, UNIQUE (org, location, ymd));
//  6. the board counts with the board's own SQL (handleBoardDashboard) and, for the pharmacist only, leave requests
