   inspection" on the Inspection check means the same on every device of the pharmacy.
   GET /registers/last-inspection             { ok, last_date: "YYYY-MM-DD" | "", set_name, updated_at } (one read)
   PUT /registers/last-inspection {date}      a day not after today (Malta time) and not before 2000; "" clears it.
   Signed-in staff and admins (anyone may print the pack, owner 9 Nov). org_id and location_id come from the session,
   never the body. One row per pharmacy (upsert); every change is in the audit with the day before and after.
   Additive: a new table only; no existing table, row or route changes.
